<title>USA: OccuSystems buys Occupational Medicine.</title>
<headline>OccuSystems buys Occupational Medicine.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>OccuSystems Inc said Tuesday it had agreed to buy Occupational Medicine of Columbus (Ga.) for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The merger, expected to be effective as of December 31, will be accretive to OccuSystems's earnings in 1997, OccuSystems said.</p>
<p>It also said the purchasers of its six percent unsecured convertible subordinated notes exercised in full their option to purchase an additional $12.75 million principal amount of the notes.</p>
</text>
